    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The red pendant of this necklace has 9 charges and regains 1d6 expended charges daily at dawn. You can also expend Hit Point Dice when you finish a Short or Long Rest to replenish its charges, each Hit Die expended restoring 1 charge.</p><p>You can expend any number of its charges to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCureWounds]{Cure Wounds} from it; the number of charges determines the spell's level (up to 9 charges for a level 9 spell).</p>",
